Well, you can normally avoid this by checking just before you move the
boulder into the corridor, but...

If you want to avoid doing anything that'll upset the puzzle or affect
your luck, just used ranged attacks.  Any projectiles, spells or wands
will work, although you should stay away from striking and force bolt,
which will break the boulder, and teleport, which doesn't change one's
luck, but may render the puzzle unsolvable.  You can also polymorph in
the direction of the boulder, but you might as well just use a pickaxe
if you don't mind the combination of losing a boulder and some luck.

